06-walking-section.jpg","c":"The Walking Section congratulate Joe Coleman following his election to the President's office. L to R; Back row. Carl Lawton, Mike Scamell, John Keown John Newman, Russell Day, John Dunsford. Middle. John Morris, Fred Denny, Richard Dorman, JOE COLEMAN, John Llewellin,Ed. Crossingham, Tom Carter, Ted Stimpson, Kneeling; Graham Seatter, Ron Day, John Hall.","id":"B208-12","w":"October 1984"}],"photo":{"file":"crops/B195/B195-p15-flashback-1938-walk.jpg","caption":"To 29th January 1938 and the Belgrave 10 miles walking championship. Our picture shows J.Coleman (2nd), P.Wright (3rd), H.Churcher (1st) and L.Coleman (4th) slugging it out for the lead along Southside.","source":"B195-29","when":"October 1977"},"x":1,"share":{"d":"Joe Coleman in The Belgravian, the Belgrave Harriers club gazette, 1942–2007: 142 mentions in 62 issues, 89 race results and 4 photographs. Wrote or reported 4 items.","img":"https://belgravian-images.stephendgardner.workers.dev/belgravian/crops/B195/B195-p15-flashback-1938-walk.jpg","u":"https://stephengardner1.github.io/belgrave-harriers-data/belgravian/read/share/p-joe-coleman.html"},"legend":false}